# Files a repository generated or ported from modern-webapp-template must
# keep byte-identical to the template's default branch. scripts/
# check-template-parity.sh fetches each from the template and compares; a
# difference fails the check, so a port that grows past the template is
# caught on the pull request rather than found in the next audit. Inside the
# template itself the check passes trivially: the template is the source.
#
# Format: one path per line; the first line names the template.
template: neb-abera/modern-webapp-template
scripts/check-held-majors.sh
scripts/held-majors.mjs
scripts/held-nuget-majors.cs
scripts/check-template-parity.sh
